{"id": "official:sentence:b2f70757-bde1-4490-b90e-f3fb4c1074ee", "recordVersion": 1, "kind": "sentence", "text": "朱颜那有年年好，逞艳游、赢取如今。", "shortMeaning": "", "genre": "classic", "category": "古典诗词", "tags": ["writing"], "usageNote": "", "publicationStatus": "published", "sources": [{"id": "chinese-poetry:song300-51", "type": "public_domain_text", "title": "《高阳台》", "quote": null, "locator": "韩", "url": "https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry/blob/master/%E5%AE%8B%E8%AF%8D/%E5%AE%8B%E8%AF%8D%E4%B8%89%E7%99%BE%E9%A6%96.json", "edition": "chinese-poetry @2026-10-24（宋词三百首）", "licenseName": "公有领域原文（宋代作品）；仓库整理层 MIT", "licenseUrl": "https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry/blob/master/LICENSE", "attribution": "韩《高阳台》，宋代作品，原文属公有领域；文本整理取自 chinese-poetry 仓库。未使用任何现代译文或注释。", "evidenceStatus": "source_checked", "rightsStatus": "public_domain"}]}
{"id": "official:sentence:03682875-f75f-45e6-ba8c-c3cb95a7b447", "recordVersion": 1, "kind": "sentence", "text": "敛兵卫、阊阖门开，住传宣、又还休务。", "shortMeaning": "", "genre": "classic", "category": "古典诗词", "tags": ["writing"], "usageNote": "", "publicationStatus": "published", "sources": [{"id": "chinese-poetry:song300-269", "type": "public_domain_text", "title": "《三台》", "quote": null, "locator": "万俟咏", "url": "https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry/blob/master/%E5%AE%8B%E8%AF%8D/%E5%AE%8B%E8%AF%8D%E4%B8%89%E7%99%BE%E9%A6%96.json", "edition": "chinese-poetry @2026-10-24（宋词三百首）", "licenseName": "公有领域原文（宋代作品）；仓库整理层 MIT", "licenseUrl": "https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry/blob/master/LICENSE", "attribution": "万俟咏《三台》，宋代作品，原文属公有领域；文本整理取自 chinese-poetry 仓库。未使用任何现代译文或注释。", "evidenceStatus": "source_checked", "rightsStatus": "public_domain"}]}
{"id": "official:sentence:fd7e89a7-5ac2-4533-876a-eaa8e0a87415", "recordVersion": 1, "kind": "sentence", "text": "华骢会意，纵扬鞭、亦自行迟。", "shortMeaning": "", "genre": "classic", "category": "古典诗词", "tags": ["writing"], "usageNote": "", "publicationStatus": "published", "sources": [{"id": "chinese-poetry:song300-244", "type": "public_domain_text", "title": "《夜飞鹊・夜飞鹊慢》", "quote": null, "locator": "周邦彦", "url": "https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry/blob/master/%E5%AE%8B%E8%AF%8D/%E5%AE%8B%E8%AF%8D%E4%B8%89%E7%99%BE%E9%A6%96.json", "edition": "chinese-poetry @2026-10-24（宋词三百首）", "licenseName": "公有领域原文（宋代作品）；仓库整理层 MIT", "licenseUrl": "https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry/blob/master/LICENSE", "attribution": "周邦彦《夜飞鹊・夜飞鹊慢》，宋代作品，原文属公有领域；文本整理取自 chinese-poetry 仓库。未使用任何现代译文或注释。", "evidenceStatus": "source_checked", "rightsStatus": "public_domain"}]}
{"id": "official:sentence:4b0d97bd-15d2-4918-aee2-9a57a27fa4ce", "recordVersion": 1, "kind": "sentence", "text": "野戰格鬬死，敗馬號鳴向天悲。", "shortMeaning": "", "genre": "classic", "category": "古典诗词", "tags": ["writing"], "usageNote": "原文用字保留当时字形，未作繁简转换。", "publicationStatus": "published", "sources": [{"id": "chinese-poetry:poet.tang.0-c0f1c8ed-bbf8-4ace-ac86-91e5e57d8ece", "type": "public_domain_text", "title": "《鼓吹曲辭 戰城南》", "quote": null, "locator": "李白", "url": "https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry/blob/master/%E5%85%A8%E5%94%90%E8%AF%97/poet.tang.0.json", "edition": "chinese-poetry @2026-10-24（全唐诗 poet.tang.0.json）", "licenseName": "公有领域原文（唐代作品）；仓库整理层 MIT", "licenseUrl": "https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry/blob/master/LICENSE", "attribution": "李白《鼓吹曲辭 戰城南》，唐代作品，原文属公有领域；文本整理取自 chinese-poetry 仓库。未使用任何现代译文或注释。", "evidenceStatus": "source_checked", "rightsStatus": "public_domain"}]}
{"id": "official:sentence:f4e5f2ad-5625-43da-b77f-75abffbf45dc", "recordVersion": 1, "kind": "sentence", "text": "但願君恩顧妾深，豈惜黃金將買賦。", "shortMeaning": "", "genre": "classic", "category": "古典诗词", "tags": ["writing"], "usageNote": "原文用字保留当时字形，未作繁简转换。", "publicationStatus": "published", "sources": [{"id": "chinese-poetry:poet.tang.1000-1592dabe-c91f-48c0-b409-768223174833", "type": "public_domain_text", "title": "《相和歌辭 白頭吟二首 一》", "quote": null, "locator": "李白", "url": "https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry/blob/master/%E5%85%A8%E5%94%90%E8%AF%97/poet.tang.1000.json", "edition": "chinese-poetry @2026-10-24（全唐诗 poet.tang.1000.json）", "licenseName": "公有领域原文（唐代作品）；仓库整理层 MIT", "licenseUrl": "https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry/blob/master/LICENSE", "attribution": "李白《相和歌辭 白頭吟二首 一》，唐代作品，原文属公有领域；文本整理取自 chinese-poetry 仓库。未使用任何现代译文或注释。", "evidenceStatus": "source_checked", "rightsStatus": "public_domain"}]}
{"id": "official:sentence:6359bc2a-7003-4227-bce9-f5613ff91ee8", "recordVersion": 1, "kind": "sentence", "text": "秀色空絕世，馨香竟誰傳。", "shortMeaning": "", "genre": "classic", "category": "古典诗词", "tags": ["writing"], "usageNote": "原文用字保留当时字形，未作繁简转换。", "publicationStatus": "published", "sources": [{"id": "chinese-poetry:poet.tang.7000-518caa01-3b0b-4ed5-8ad3-bb1105723b40", "type": "public_domain_text", "title": "《古風 二十六》", "quote": null, "locator": "李白", "url": "https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry/blob/master/%E5%85%A8%E5%94%90%E8%AF%97/poet.tang.7000.json", "edition": "chinese-poetry @2026-10-24（全唐诗 poet.tang.7000.json）", "licenseName": "公有领域原文（唐代作品）；仓库整理层 MIT", "licenseUrl": "https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry/blob/master/LICENSE", "attribution": "李白《古風 二十六》，唐代作品，原文属公有领域；文本整理取自 chinese-poetry 仓库。未使用任何现代译文或注释。", "evidenceStatus": "source_checked", "rightsStatus": "public_domain"}]}
{"id": "official:sentence:854c1898-5b25-4919-b3af-8ec079c841e0", "recordVersion": 1, "kind": "sentence", "text": "恨芳菲世界，游人未赏，都付与、莺和燕。", "shortMeaning": "", "genre": "classic", "category": "古典诗词", "tags": ["writing"], "usageNote": "", "publicationStatus": "published", "sources": [{"id": "chinese-poetry:song300-119", "type": "public_domain_text", "title": "《水龙吟》", "quote": null, "locator": "陈亮", "url": "https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry/blob/master/%E5%AE%8B%E8%AF%8D/%E5%AE%8B%E8%AF%8D%E4%B8%89%E7%99%BE%E9%A6%96.json", "edition": "chinese-poetry @2026-10-24（宋词三百首）", "licenseName": "公有领域原文（宋代作品）；仓库整理层 MIT", "licenseUrl": "https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry/blob/master/LICENSE", "attribution": "陈亮《水龙吟》，宋代作品，原文属公有领域；文本整理取自 chinese-poetry 仓库。未使用任何现代译文或注释。", "evidenceStatus": "source_checked", "rightsStatus": "public_domain"}]}
{"id": "official:sentence:878b4250-2b2f-4799-ac53-2a0dd461164a", "recordVersion": 1, "kind": "sentence", "text": "却是有，年年塞雁，归来曾见开时。", "shortMeaning": "", "genre": "classic", "category": "送别思乡", "tags": ["writing"], "usageNote": "", "publicationStatus": "published", "sources": [{"id": "chinese-poetry:song300-109", "type": "public_domain_text", "title": "《汉宫春》", "quote": null, "locator": "李邴", "url": "https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry/blob/master/%E5%AE%8B%E8%AF%8D/%E5%AE%8B%E8%AF%8D%E4%B8%89%E7%99%BE%E9%A6%96.json", "edition": "chinese-poetry @2026-10-24（宋词三百首）", "licenseName": "公有领域原文（宋代作品）；仓库整理层 MIT", "licenseUrl": "https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry/blob/master/LICENSE", "attribution": "李邴《汉宫春》，宋代作品，原文属公有领域；文本整理取自 chinese-poetry 仓库。未使用任何现代译文或注释。", "evidenceStatus": "source_checked", "rightsStatus": "public_domain"}]}
